  "description": "To request a viewing, please email the full details of the proposed tenants along with the preferred lease start date.\n\n- Bright, newly refurbished 2-bed, 2-bath apartment in Old City Music Hall, Cows Lane, Temple Bar\n- Fully furnished and in turnkey condition\n- Two double bedrooms, each with a double bed, wardrobe space and large windows\n- Master bedroom with en-suite shower room\n- Main bathroom with bath and shower over, heated towel rail\n- Open-plan living and dining area with large windows and wooden flooring\n- Corner sofa, TV, dining table and seating included\n- Fitted kitchen with oven, hob, extractor, fridge-freezer, dishwasher and washing machine\n- Walk to Dublin Castle in 2 minutes and Christ Church Cathedral in 3\n- Dame Street bus stop 4 minutes away (routes 27, 77A, 150, 151)\n- Luas Red Line (Jervis, Four Courts) about 9 minutes on foot, Green Line at St Stephen's Green about 15\n- Trinity College 9 minutes, Grafton Street 12 minutes, Tara Street DART about 17 minutes on foot\n- Surrounded by cafes, restaurants, bars and live music in Temple Bar\n- Everything in the city centre within walking distance",
